message: "If you use this software or benchmark, please cite the archived release and the associated manuscript."
title: "Scaffold hopping from deposited crystal pairs: a docking-free contact-conservation benchmark and a structure-validated method"
type: software
version: 0.1.3
date-released: 2026-11-20
license: MIT
