abstract: >-
  Benchmark of 2,886 same-pocket, different-scaffold ligand pairs from the PDB, a
  60,069-rule core-replacement lexicon, a constrained interaction ranker, an
  equal-diversity control, and an EDIA ligand electron-density audit (528 ligand
  instances, 522 entries) with the gate used by the construction code. Includes
  scaffold- and target-held-out evaluations, ablations, and a 22-compound
  prospective panel.
keywords:
  - scaffold hopping
  - structure-based drug design
  - interaction fingerprint
  - benchmark
  - ChEMBL
  - PDB
